"}], "value": "Can associate with other claudins to regulate tight junction structural and functional strand dynamics (PubMed:35773259, PubMed:36008380). May coassemble with CLDN8 into tight junction strands containing anion-selective channels that convey paracellular chloride permeability in renal collecting ducts (By similarity) (PubMed:36008380). May integrate into CLDN3 strands to modulate localized tight junction barrier properties (PubMed:35773259, PubMed:36008380). May disrupt strand assembly of channel-forming CLDN2 and CLDN15 and inhibit cation conductance (PubMed:35773259, PubMed:36008380). Cannot form tight junction strands on its own (PubMed:35773259, PubMed:36008380)"}], "commentType": "FUNCTION"}, {"commentType": "CATALYTIC ACTIVITY", "reaction": {"name": "chloride(in) = chloride(out)", "reactionCrossReferences": [{"database": "Rhea", "id": "RHEA:29823"}, {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:17996"}], "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O35054"}]}}, {"commentType": "CATALYTIC ACTIVITY", "reaction": {"name": "bromide(in) = bromide(out)", "reactionCrossReferences": [{"database": "Rhea", "id": "RHEA:75383"}, {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:15858"}], "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O35054"}]}}, {"commentType": "CATALYTIC ACTIVITY", "reaction": {"name": "iodide(out) = iodide(in)", "reactionCrossReferences": [{"database": "Rhea", "id": "RHEA:66324"}, {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:16382"}], "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O35054"}]}}, {"commentType": "CATALYTIC ACTIVITY", "reaction": {"name": "fluoride(in) = fluoride(out)", "reactionCrossReferences": [{"database": "Rhea", "id": "RHEA:76159"}, {"database": "ChEBI", "id": "CHEBI:17051"}], "evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O35054"}]}}, {"texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250", "source": "UniProtKB", "id": "O35054"}, {"evide